t stay at home all day"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"People who lose a loved one to suicide, accident, or homicide should seek professional help rather than trying to cope alone"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"In the first six months after losing a spouse, assign one trusted person to oversee meals, sleep, medication for chronic conditions, and follow‑up appointments"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"For those without family or friends, replace “the person watching over you” with three simple things: a neighbor who can enter your home, a spot on the community outreach list, and emergency contacts saved on your phone"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"After a parent dies, tell the child the truth, let him attend the funeral, and don’t send him to another environment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Still stuck in grief after half a year, unable to move on — when to see a psychiatrist or clinical psychologist"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Don’t spend money on grief counseling right away — first check whether your grief is truly stuck (see the symptoms listed in item 8)"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Don’t drop yibao or turn to alcohol after separating or divorcing"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Call 12356 for general support, 12355 for minors and teens; for medical care, book a psychology clinic appointment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"In the first three months after a tragedy, postpone any irreversible major decisions"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/29-13","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Don’t treat death as a way to settle debts: life insurance won’t pay out for suicides within two years, workplace injuries won’t be recognized, and debts are still deducted from your estate first"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/29"},"children":["Chapter 29"," ·"," ","After experiencing a major setback"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"29-13"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["13"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Don’t treat death as a way to settle debts: life insurance won’t pay out for suicides within two years, workplace injuries won’t be recognized, and debts are still deducted from your estate first"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["If you commit suicide within two years of buying a life insurance policy, the insurer won’t pay out any benefits — only the cash value of the policy is returned. Workplace injuries also won’t be recognized, so no compensation is paid for a work-related death. Any outstanding debts are deducted from your estate first, leaving only the remainder for your family. They also have to bear the health consequences described in Section 4 of this chapter (relatives of suicide victims face a 7–8 times higher risk of developing a mental disorder within five years)."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There is no expense involved;"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Article 44 of the Insurance Law governs contracts where death is the condition for payout. Within two years of…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Don’t treat death as a way to settle debts: life insurance won’t pay out for suicides within two years, workplace injuries won’t be recognized, and debts are still deducted from your estate first"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There is no expense involved; you just need to do the math."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Article 44 of the Insurance Law governs contracts where death is the condition for payout. Within two years of the policy’s start or reinstatement, if the insured person commits suicide, the insurer is not obligated to pay any benefits. However, if the insured was legally incapable of making decisions at the time of suicide, the insurer must return the policy’s cash value — meaning only a partial refund, not the full coverage amount. Typical life insurance payouts run into the hundreds of thousands of yuan, so this benefit is considered substantial. Article 16(3) of the Work Injury Insurance Regulations states that self-harm or suicide does not qualify as a work injury, so none of the three types of compensation for work-related deaths apply: a six-month funeral allowance based on local average monthly wages, survivor’s pensions, and a one-time payment equal to 20 times the national per capita disposable income. Articles 1159 and 1161 of the Civil Code stipulate that estate settlement must first cover all legally required taxes and debts, with heirs only receiving what remains — they’re liable only up to the value of the inherited assets, and can avoid this obligation by renouncing their inheritance."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2015 修正). 中华人民共和国保险法第四十四条. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7c4060811","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7c4060811"]},"；国务院 (2010 修订). 工伤保险条例（国务院令第 586 号）第十六条、第三十九条. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2011/content_1778064.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2011/content_1778064.htm"]},"；全国人大 (2020). 中华人民共和国民法典第一千一百五十九条、第一千一百六十一条. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7c4060811","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["This entry focuses solely on financial implications. Other entries in this section and Section 1 aim to prevent such situations from occurring. Article 44 of the Insurance Law applies only to the first two years after purchase; it is included here for completeness, not as a strict timeline. The health risks for family members are detailed in Section 4. For help dealing with suicidal thoughts, see Sections 1.25 and 1.32; information on post-survival complications can be found in Section 1.33. The exact amounts for the three work injury benefits are listed in Section 19.15, while the procedures for accessing housing provident funds and social insurance benefits from an estate are explained in Section 25.9. 〔100000〕"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/29-12"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"In the first three months after a tragedy, postpone any irreversible major decisions"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["More in this topic"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/29-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["For those without family or friends, replace “the person watching over you” with three simple things: a neighbor who can enter your home, a spot on the community out